Z||000004||MinnGreenGT||11-15-2001||10:18 AM||||Welcome to the forum.<P>As to where to buy an '88GT to start... there's a couple in the "Mall" section of the forum right now (one's an '88GT w/a new 3.4L Camaro Motor listed at $5500- Doh! Wish I had an extra bundle of cash laying around). Otherwise there are usually a few on Ebay at any given time.<P>As to where you want to go with it... a plan is a good thing!  You can then budget and spread out your project to avoid putting yourself in severe debt over it (I've had my car for 7 years now...and It's still not nearly finished).  Good luck. And when in doubt (search first...) just ask!<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
